<title>USA: PCX to list nine new equity options on August 13.</title>
<headline>PCX to list nine new equity options on August 13.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Friday it will list options on nine stocks on Wednesday, August 13.</p>
<p>The stocks include: Eclipse Surgical Technologies Inc, KeraVision Inc, Key Energy Group Inc, Maxxim Medical Inc and Optical Coating Laboratory Inc.</p>
<p>Also, Romac International Inc, St. John Knits Inc, Silicon Valley Bancshares and TriNet Corporate Realty Trust.  </p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and lead market maker. Ticker	Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts  Lead Mkt Maker</p>
